{"parse": {"title": "红墙-03", "pageid": 65747, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><p><br /></p><div class=\"headnote-box\"><div style=\"display:flex; align-items:center;\">\n<div style=\"margin-right:1.5em;\"><img alt=\"Icon daojishi 1.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/40/Icon_daojishi_1.png/25px-Icon_daojishi_1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"no-select\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/40/Icon_daojishi_1.png/38px-Icon_daojishi_1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/40/Icon_daojishi_1.png/50px-Icon_daojishi_1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"70\" data-file-height=\"70\" /></div>\n<div style=\"flex:1; min-width:0; line-height:1.2em\" class=\"serif\"><b>页面正在编辑中：</b><b>推理游戏及对话内容计划添加中。</b><br /><small style=\"color:#999\">内容可能随时更新。诚挚邀请您一同<a href=\"/wiki/%E7%89%B9%E6%AE%8A:EditPage/%E7%BA%A2%E5%A2%99-03\" title=\"特殊:EditPage/红墙-03\">参与编辑</a>。</small></div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%BA%A2%E5%A2%99-02\" title=\"红墙-02\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">红墙-03</span><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%BA%A2%E5%A2%99-04\" title=\"红墙-04\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">红墙</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">03</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E6.AF.A1.E5.B8.BD.E4.B8.8E.E6.89.8B.E6.9E.AA\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"毡帽与手枪\">毡帽与手枪</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 毡帽与手枪</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\"></div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"story-text\"><div>也许是尚且无法形成判断，也许是出于对神秘学家的忌惮，在一场双方都无甚收获的问询之后，阿尔古斯被缴枪释放了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但她并不可能真正离开自己的枪。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_1_bg_meiguonanbu.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_1_bg_meiguonanbu\"><img alt=\"2_1_bg_meiguonanbu\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/07/Cg-2_1_bg_meiguonanbu.png/600px-Cg-2_1_bg_meiguonanbu.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/07/Cg-2_1_bg_meiguonanbu.png/900px-Cg-2_1_bg_meiguonanbu.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/07/Cg-2_1_bg_meiguonanbu.png/1200px-Cg-2_1_bg_meiguonanbu.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"611601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/HeadIconSmall-611601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-611601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"611601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/HeadIconSmall-611601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-611601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/HeadIconSmall-611601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-611601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">治安官：</div><div>……你怎么还在这儿？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"611601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/HeadIconSmall-611601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-611601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"611601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/HeadIconSmall-611601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-611601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/HeadIconSmall-611601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-611601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">治安官：</div><div>如果你决定暂时待在这儿，那就别到处乱晃。没了枪，这儿没人能保证你的安全。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"611601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/HeadIconSmall-611601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-611601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"611601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/HeadIconSmall-611601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-611601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/HeadIconSmall-611601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-611601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">治安官：</div><div>等我巡逻回来，我们再谈。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>行，行。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>敷衍地晃了两下头表示确认，阿尔古斯注视着治安官驱车离开镇上。根据方向判断，在治安官回来之前，她还有大约四个小时的调查时间。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一场边境巡逻需要的大概时间。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>……哼。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>再拖下去天都要亮了，得想办法先回到那个办公室去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>盘算之下，阿尔古斯迈步向荒草丛生的小镇边缘绕去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>……听声音，门锁居然还是十几年前的样式……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>嘶——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>哦，开了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>呃……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>夜盲不出意外如影随形，她只能往嘴里扔进一枚救急的糖果，然后闭上眼睛。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>呼——让我看看——</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-bangongshihunan.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"bangongshihunan\"><img alt=\"bangongshihunan\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/Cg-bangongshihunan.png/600px-Cg-bangongshihunan.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/Cg-bangongshihunan.png/900px-Cg-bangongshihunan.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/Cg-bangongshihunan.png/1200px-Cg-bangongshihunan.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>而后，“百眼巨人”再度醒转。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在逐渐清晰的视野中，雇佣兵回到刚才接受过盘问的地方。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在无人发现的情况下顺利回到这里花费了比预想更多的时间和力气，所幸她身上携带的苦目糖数量尚足，屋内留下的微弱灯光也对夜晚视物多少有所帮助。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>宝贝儿，你在哪儿呢……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>哦，你在这里！我可不能再和你分开了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>拿回霰弹枪之后，她先端详起墙上的小镇地图。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>这镇上没有档案室。如果所谓的“红墙”真的涉及命案，相关的档案就只可能保存在这里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>我得仔细瞧瞧……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>文书的廓形广泛分布在整个房间以内，阿尔古斯有意识地循着新鲜的摩擦痕迹去寻找。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>人们自然剥落的少许皮肤，手指接触纸面留下的轻微褶皱，无一不是她所能留意的线索。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309714.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/HeadIconSmall-309714.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309714.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309714.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/HeadIconSmall-309714.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309714.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/HeadIconSmall-309714.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309714.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>……在我离开之后，他翻开过一些档案……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309716.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/HeadIconSmall-309716.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309716.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309716.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/HeadIconSmall-309716.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309716.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/HeadIconSmall-309716.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309716.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309718.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-309718.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309718.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309718.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-309718.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309718.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-309718.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309718.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>感谢淳朴的小镇男孩吧！他们连色情杂志都只知道放床底下，当然不会用保险箱。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-bangongshihunan.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"bangongshihunan\"><img alt=\"bangongshihunan\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/Cg-bangongshihunan.png/600px-Cg-bangongshihunan.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/Cg-bangongshihunan.png/900px-Cg-bangongshihunan.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/Cg-bangongshihunan.png/1200px-Cg-bangongshihunan.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>雇佣兵站在室内那盏光线微弱的台灯下，持续透支着自己的能力，只为从文书上找到能够解释白天所遭遇一切异常的答案。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309714.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/HeadIconSmall-309714.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309714.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309714.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/HeadIconSmall-309714.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309714.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/HeadIconSmall-309714.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309714.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>“失踪案。1962年……1973年……”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309714.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/HeadIconSmall-309714.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309714.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309714.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/HeadIconSmall-309714.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309714.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/HeadIconSmall-309714.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309714.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>“车祸……溺亡……”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“红墙”似乎不是一个被官方承认的称呼，此轮寻找或许要以失败告终了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309714.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/HeadIconSmall-309714.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309714.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309714.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/HeadIconSmall-309714.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309714.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/HeadIconSmall-309714.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309714.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>“连环杀人案……”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>不——等等——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>啊……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她对这样的情况习以为常。明明只需要坚持一会儿，再坚持一会儿——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>阿尔古斯再次吞下糖，停止一切动作，只去感受视野再次变得清晰。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-bangongshihunan.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"bangongshihunan\"><img alt=\"bangongshihunan\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/Cg-bangongshihunan.png/600px-Cg-bangongshihunan.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/Cg-bangongshihunan.png/900px-Cg-bangongshihunan.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/Cg-bangongshihunan.png/1200px-Cg-bangongshihunan.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>接着，她更加迅速地翻找起来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309714.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/HeadIconSmall-309714.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309714.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309714.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/HeadIconSmall-309714.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309714.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/HeadIconSmall-309714.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309714.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>断墙……“1981年……1984年……圣地亚哥疗养院附近……院墙遗址——”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309714.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/HeadIconSmall-309714.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309714.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309714.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/HeadIconSmall-309714.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309714.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/HeadIconSmall-309714.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309714.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>院墙遗址？一座战地医院的院墙遗址？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309714.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/HeadIconSmall-309714.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309714.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309714.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/HeadIconSmall-309714.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309714.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/HeadIconSmall-309714.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309714.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>这就是红墙吗？没有命案？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309714.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/HeadIconSmall-309714.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309714.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309714.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/HeadIconSmall-309714.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309714.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/HeadIconSmall-309714.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309714.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>太奇怪了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309714.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/HeadIconSmall-309714.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309714.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309714.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/HeadIconSmall-309714.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309714.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/HeadIconSmall-309714.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309714.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>但也没有找到其他与“墙”关联的信息，而且治安官检视过这份档案，也许就是这个。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309714.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/HeadIconSmall-309714.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309714.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309714.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/HeadIconSmall-309714.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309714.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/HeadIconSmall-309714.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309714.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>坐标是在——我看看——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309714.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/HeadIconSmall-309714.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309714.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309714.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/HeadIconSmall-309714.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309714.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/HeadIconSmall-309714.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309714.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>嗯？没有？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309714.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/HeadIconSmall-309714.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309714.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309714.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/HeadIconSmall-309714.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309714.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/HeadIconSmall-309714.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309714.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>怎么会没有坐标呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>另一份档案在调查走入死胡同时“恰到好处”地出现了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>红色的棉线缠绕的不只是牛皮纸袋的封口，更是整个袋子的半身。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一枚猩红的印章被掩盖在棉线之下，辨认不出来历，却仿若黑暗之中的一声枪响，震颤了发掘它的闯入者。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309714.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/HeadIconSmall-309714.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309714.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309714.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/HeadIconSmall-309714.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309714.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/HeadIconSmall-309714.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309714.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>……看来，我找到大的了。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "包含顶注的页面", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "编辑中的页面"}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "红墙-03"}}